{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05896","headline":"苦热 · 王维","name":"苦热","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤日满天地，火云成山岳。\n草木尽焦卷，川泽皆竭涸。\n轻纨觉衣重，密树苦阴薄。\n莞簟不可近，絺綌再三濯。\n思出宇宙外，旷然在寥廓。\n长风万里来，江海荡烦浊。\n却顾身爲患，始知心未觉。\n忽入甘露门，宛然清凉乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}